  "label": "Social Norm of Gratitude",
  "description": "The expectation in many cultures that when someone expresses thanks ('thank you'), the recipient should respond with 'you're welcome' as a polite acknowledgment. This norm is culturally ingrained and forms the basis for the meme's humor, which arises from the absurdity of the child's reaction to this expected response.",
